<title>POLAND: GORAZDZE NOV NET RISES TO PLN 5.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>GORAZDZE NOV NET RISES TO PLN 5.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.26 vs   4.33</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.32 vs   4.34</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.25 vs   1.79</p>
<p> Sales		   20.76 vs  16.05</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    59.28 vs  68.08</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	59.43 vs  68.33</p>
<p> Operating profit    42.58 vs  55.37</p>
<p> Sales		  215.33 vs 211.89</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish cement maker is Zaklady</p>
<p>Cementowo-Wapiennicze Gorazdze SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
